# Extension rules

- TypeScript in `editors/code/` talks to the `vscode` API only.
- Product logic lives in `crates/` (Rust). CLI subprocess or stdio LSP.
- Do not reimplement the crate in TS. Do not call `vscode` from Rust.
- Lazy `activationEvents`. Tokens in SecretStorage.
- Cursor installs from Open VSX. Bundle or document the native binary.
- Same publisher.extension ID if dual-publishing.
